{"title": "Timmask", "pageid": 27563, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Timmask", "categories": ["Resistant to all Piercing", "Resistant to all Necrotic", "Resistant to all Radiant", "Immune to all Poison", "Immune to all Psychic", "Vulnerable to Fire", "Environmental objects", "Mushrooms"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Timmask</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Timmask_Mushroom.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Timmask Mushroom.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Timmask_Mushroom.png/300px-Timmask_Mushroom.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Timmask_Mushroom.png/300px-Timmask_Mushroom.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Timmask_Mushroom.png/600px-Timmask_Mushroom.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Timmask Mushroom.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"191\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-panel-scroll-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"pi-section-navigation\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pi-section-tab pi-item-spacing pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-label\">Balanced</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"pi-section-contents\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-content pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Balanced Difficulty Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hp\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">HP</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Resistances <sup><a href=\"/wiki/Resistances\" title=\"Resistances\">(info)</a></sup></h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"resistances\" data-item-name=\"resistances\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/42px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/56px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/42px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/56px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Vulnerable to Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/28px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/42px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/56px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vulnerable to Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/28px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>Timmask</b> are mushrooms which release spores that cause the <a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\">Befuddled</a> condition, if a creature gets too close to one.\n\n<center class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<table style=\"background: none;\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: top;\">“\n</td>\n<td><blockquote style=\"margin: 0; font-style: italic\">Also known as 'the Devil's Mushroom' for its mind-altering effects.</blockquote>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: bottom;\">„\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Timmasks can be found in various locations in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>. Their <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(ingredient)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (ingredient)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/30px-Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/40px-Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(ingredient)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (ingredient)\">spores</a> are also an <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">alchemical ingredient</a>. Three spores can be combined to create <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Timmask_Spores\" title=\"Essence of Timmask Spores\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Essence_of_Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Essence_of_Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/30px-Essence_of_Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Essence_of_Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/40px-Essence_of_Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Essence_of_Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Essence_of_Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Timmask_Spores\" title=\"Essence of Timmask Spores\">Essence of Timmask Spores</a>, an extract used in crafting the grenade; <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fungal_Bamboozler\" title=\"Fungal Bamboozler\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fungal_Bamboozler\" title=\"Fungal Bamboozler\">Fungal Bamboozler</a>.\n</p><p>Destroying a Timmask specimen along with <b>all</b> other kinds of hazardous mushrooms in the Underdark grants an <a href=\"/wiki/Inspiration\" title=\"Inspiration\">inspirational</a> event <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Outlander#Mushroom_Enthusiast\" title=\"Outlander\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mushroom Enthusiast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Outlander#Mushroom_Enthusiast\" title=\"Outlander\">Mushroom Enthusiast</a> for characters with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/20px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/30px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/40px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Outlander\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/20px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\">Outlander</a> background.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"When_destroyed\">When destroyed</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\" style=\"overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(cloud)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/45px-Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/60px-Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Timmask Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(cloud)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (cloud)\">Timmask Spores</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 1 m (3 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 1 m (3 ft) Radius</p>\n<div>\n<p>Chance to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Befuddle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\">Befuddle</a> creatures.\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Cloud</a></dd>\n\n</dl><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Befuddled\"> Condition: Befuddled </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt